### 1. SCOPE OF SERVICES & DELIVERABLES (WEB APP ONLY)
1.1 The Developer shall design, build, and deploy the Platform strictly as a responsive, high-SEO **Web Application & Progressive Web App (PWA)**, encompassing the following five core functional modules:
* **Module 1: High-SEO Public Marketplace & Granular Location Engine:** Programmatic category and location routing covering all 36 States, FCT, and 774 Local Government Areas (LGAs) of Nigeria (e.g., "Solar Installer in Owerri Municipal", "AC Technician in Ikeja"), fast search, filtering by price, rating, and verification badges.
* **Module 2: Service Provider Profiles & Portfolio Showcase:** Rich service pages featuring before-and-after photo galleries, call-out / starting rates, working hours, coverage radius, verified KYC badges, and customer review submission.
* **Module 3: Instant Lead Generation & Contact Suite:** "Reveal Phone Number" with click-logging analytics (so providers can see leads received), one-click pre-filled WhatsApp inquiry button, and real-time quote request messaging.
* **Module 4: Monetization Engine (Ad Boosting & Subscriptions):** Featured listing packages (VIP Gold, Silver, Urgent Tag, Homepage Carousel), recurring pro subscriptions, and automated checkout via Paystack (Cards, USSD, Bank Transfer).
* **Module 5: Administrator & Moderation Desk:** Admin dashboard to moderate new service listings, verify submitted KYC documents, manage categories/ad boosting pricing, and inspect lead analytics.

1.2 **Exclusion of Native App Store Binaries:** This Agreement is strictly for the **Web Platform & Progressive Web App (PWA)**. Native mobile applications compiled for the Apple App Store or Google Play Store are expressly excluded from this scope and may be contracted under a separate mobile extension agreement.

