### 2. COMMERCIAL FEES, PRICE BREAKDOWN & PAYMENT MILESTONES
2.1 **Total Contract Price:** The total professional fee for the complete development, staging, and launch of the Platform is **₦450,000 (Four Hundred and Fifty Thousand Naira)**.

2.2 **Commercial Breakdown & Price Justification (₦450,000):**
The agreed price represents an optimized, high-value MVP architecture designed for rapid go-to-market execution without compromising code quality, security, or SEO performance:
* **Component 1: System Architecture, DB Schemas & 774 LGA Location Engine (₦120,000):** Relational PostgreSQL database modeling, Prisma schema design, location indexing across all 36 States + FCT + 774 LGAs, secure authentication, and session handling.
* **Component 2: High-SEO Public Discovery, Category Routing & Search Engine (₦110,000):** Server-Side Rendered (SSR) programmatic SEO pages engineered for Google ranking, responsive mobile-first UI/UX, multi-tier category taxonomy, and filtering algorithms.
* **Component 3: Provider Profiles, Portfolio Showcase & Lead Tracking (₦90,000):** Multi-image before/after media upload vault (Cloudflare R2), telephone click logger and analytics counter, click-to-WhatsApp deep-linking, and customer rating/review engine.
* **Component 4: Monetization Engine: Ad Boosting & Paystack Checkout (₦80,000):** Paystack API integration for automated ad boost purchases, featured placement algorithms, duration expiry cron jobs, and billing records.
* **Component 5: Admin Moderation Desk, Cloud Deployment & Warranty (₦50,000):** Administrative moderation workflow, KYC verification desk, cloud deployment on Railway/DigitalOcean, DNS configuration, and 60-day post-launch warranty support.

2.3 **Milestone Payment Schedule:**
